Supplementary Code S1
Binding Site Validation Using the Native KEAP1–NRF2 Complex (PDB: 2FLU)

Purpose
This script identifies the native protein–protein interaction (PPI) interface between KEAP1 and the NRF2 ETGE peptide using the crystal structure (PDB ID:2FLU). The identified interface residues are compared with the docking pocket used during virtual screening to validate the biological relevance of the selected binding site.

Input
1. Native crystal structure (2FLU)
2. User-defined docking pocket residues

Output
1. List of interface residues
2. Pocket overlap statistics
3. Hotspot residue identification
4. CSV file containing all interface residues

Software
Python 3.11
Biopython >=1.85
Pandas >=2.2

Author
Umair Wahedi et al.

